{
  "data": {
    "content": {
      "title": "Agent 开发时代，TRAE 先动手了",
      "nick_name": "苍何",
      "author": "苍何",
      "user_name": "gh_fdb597c42fa4",
      "desc": "全新升级的 TRAE 来啦",
      "content_noencode": "<center><span style=\"background:#d3f8b6;\"><span leaf=\"\">这是苍何的第 607 篇原创！</span></span></center><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是苍何。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">国庆这几天我基本没出门，窝在家里折腾自己的产品 WeSight。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">刚好拿到了 TRAE 新版本的内测资格，就先装上体验了几天。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这次 TraeWork 和 TraeCode 双端合并，升级成了全新的 Agent 模式的 TRAE。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaDL2PC7RHcibs3HuOAVX8o1VVvyRXibuF64E2wU1z3Sf5oNBxcOTcGNl5GqwBmfvn6APQ5IINPkzLmKmic6NibsTicUMPrQfoSf1GZ8/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4527777777777778\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我还挺感慨的，说实话，从 Trae 刚出来我就在用，算是看着它一路长大的，也是 Trae 的骨灰级用户了。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">去年 1 月 Trae 刚出来，我就是第一批用户。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">那时候它真不算好用，Mac 上内存占用高，写着写着还会闪退，身边人提起 AI 编程，张口闭口都是 Cursor。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">它几乎没什么存在感。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">可我发现，它一直在闷头更新，一个版本接一个版本。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我当时脑子里冒出一句话：人若无名，便可专心练剑。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">后来 SOLO 出来，一个邀请码在闲鱼被炒到几百块。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAB4n057I7cZbWushpg31hibczYE5UTmC6c5vPzfiaGjKa3Mm3XrO9MVBgBWlFQq6DnZMp9htZsaMapUYfsKPJVvvkSCp9bWRljU/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.40122199592668023\" data-w=\"982\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我厚着脸皮托了关系，在发布前 4 小时拿到码，一个人对着屏幕玩到凌晨 2 点。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">那天晚上我是真的兴奋，感觉自己看到了 AI 编程的未来。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAvDzDeiajDIEJGLl6DOXQDYxk2D3UGPhV97FQAxrGKILE1rGJ0NtyibIlPoibvMdwibTzXeLVkVGAGGC2iblAawXTLxRYSEZHazJ9k/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.794392523364486\" data-w=\"642\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">再后来，我成了武汉的 TRAE Fellow。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">去年 11 月在字节武汉工区办 Meetup，原本心里没底，结果来了两百多人。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/zw8bZHsVSaB2Hk3ic395CibjiarUhHicvh2qpZvxc8SAWlia2LhfiadvIrMicDWicsR1Xtqnx2bfADFmfWReUyNwZjOS5IXEUEffuGHMlDlILxuI8eg/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6222222222222222\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">运营同学私下跟我说他都惊呆了，没想到武汉对 Trae 这么热。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">他不知道的是，我在台下比他还激动。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">和运营 luna 吃饭的时候，聊起他们在做的事，我能看到她眼睛里冒着光。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">那一刻我就信了一句话：</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(46, 167, 101);font-weight: 700;\"><span leaf=\"\">唯有热爱和激情不会骗人。</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">一年多下来，我在 TRAE 的活动上分享了 5 次，还去武大给学生讲过工程实践。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">当年那个动不动就闪退的 IDE，现在我 16 G 的 Mac 多开都不卡了。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">今年 4 月 SOLO 独立出去，后来 TRAE 分成了 TraeWork 和 TraeCode。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">现在，它们又合回了一个新的 TRAE。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我反而更看懂了它想做的事，</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(46, 167, 101);font-weight: 700;\"><span leaf=\"\">在 Agent 开发时代，他们想做一个全链路开发最好的工具。</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">你可以看到 Agent 模式打开是一个工作台，左边放项目，中间放任务。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这种形态，常用 Codex 的朋友应该不陌生。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">以 Agent 为中心，人负责提需求、看结果、做判断，编辑器只在需要深改时才打开，这已经是今年 AI Coding 的主流形态了。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">所以 Agent 模式本身谈不上新鲜，TRAE 这次要做的，是把开发从「让一个 Agent 帮我写代码」，升级成「指挥多个 Agent，从想法一路做到交付」。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">需求、设计、代码、测试、交付在同一个项目里闭环，前一步的产物就是后一步的上下文；一个工作台调度所有项目和 Agent，进度一目了然，深改时一键切回 IDE。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">再加上桌面、网页、移动端同步，新手拿它当全能开发助手，老手拿它当全局工作台。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">说起来挺巧，去年 FORCE 大会上，我身后那页 PPT 写的就是：从单纯的编码工具，到全生命周期开发平台。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/zw8bZHsVSaAAeOkvfmpUM5tfISTwrHcKRAiarIpP1jsS7URtPreyM6LMxu4aMdnqRsKQddQ4p6jJHu2wTYTib18nVLS8T6PSJhshRWYTqj7qQ/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">一年多过去，TRAE 真把这件事做出来了。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">正好国庆在折腾 WeSight，我来进行了下深度使用。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">WeSight 现在有两个端，一个是网页版的创作空间，一个是 Obsidian 插件。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">两边很多规则是共用的，每次加功能都得两头改，拿来试刚好。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我把两个仓库都拖了进去。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaBpd18mc5KrY1Dzia4E4rpDsxUmTTRhvF88F2GxLkgk1WBp6iaHPRnZaAj6apDpIX44Qibxp02Y4HA45dtPXsuM9UE1vPp3XQibeKY/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4203703703703704\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近一直想加个小功能，写完文章点一下，帮我查查错别字、敏感词，顺便给标题打个分。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我把这个需求交给 TRAE 的 Agent 模式：</span></p><blockquote style=\"margin: 20px 0px;padding: 10px 20px;color: rgb(44, 62, 80);background-color: rgb(240, 253, 244);border-left: 4px solid rgb(66, 185, 131);border-radius: 4px;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.6;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;padding: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\">给 WeSight 的 Web 端和 Obsidian 插件同时加一个发布前文章体检功能，检查错别字、敏感词，并给标题打分，两端规则保持一致。先出 PRD 和原型。</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">很快出来一份 PRD。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAwoRhVEhDcicBzia9m1dkubuYhZ9N4krUg4fIxWJwaMZkoPghlvqlxJbJsBwkwUdqZicevb2vns4ZyJOcPLYjlkL5lavRoDpXch0/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5962962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">还有个能点的页面原型：</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAcYoRwahkrk9cIJZ11NaRqSM4a2cRezSlchUVMhPGZwuprCK3BQt8WicbD9DnpTqicxLmW8YqOpGXibobDpAtfLVQdCbvKdzK4uE/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.600925925925926\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">说实话方案写得中规中矩，我改了两处，但两端规则要共用一份这点它是考虑到了。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这里产生的 PRD 和原型文档都会沉淀到「我的产物」里面。打开就能直接看。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaDBzHictzgiccZnPL9nD1ERmMiatQLalH4pWTUgXzaHfgjRmmzvW1F3qBsw4DPWWbPkc8rgINpFIcCBwyonjAIagsWL5RyULLV5SE/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5925925925925926\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">方案定了，开始干活。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我在同一个工作台里，给两个项目各派了一个 Agent，一个改插件，一个改网页端，同时跑。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这里可以直接把刚才的交付产物作为上下文使用的。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAMlnKdTuDT5JZQSCx5NFFiaqZTibRgvPGZP1OvPtibpqlV5vdvcgkbzwmzuAVeJ3AmfPIglS0ia7X58ZOthkDqA262RQjQxvsfYWw/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4898148148148148\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">又单独开了一个 Agent 专门写测试，两边的用例都交给它。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">单个 Agent 写代码的水平，跟我平时用 Claude Code、Codex 差不多。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">让我觉得顺的，是这种一个工作台管所有项目的方式。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">插件那边先把共享规则改完，我直接让网页端的任务照着这份规则来，跨项目推进不用我来回复制。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">真遇到要抠细节的地方，从任务里一键切到 IDE，改完再回来。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我去做了点事情，回来两边都改得差不多了。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaCm0I4HweGbibPAMF1dvdksMQIShLrz6ZDUsdYpSIUcnmX3yNTP017j2dRl0zTEANHOplN8y0FFfUpkN1ibxekVO2y4PRskFc8ow