ar, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">连接飞书后，我在飞书里直接下达指令，让它根据这次的产物，帮我写更新日志和用户公告。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这里的 Agent 上下文记忆能力还是挺不错的。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">它直接去翻了项目产物里的 PRD、代码变更和测试报告，写出来的东西是有依据的。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaBtVmvjd44oEeAIscbbNe4zmt1U2HaBogiaYUrJnhPJdGVJIYVVBj3C2lRDOBJo9brFONMLYG5GB5k0mzicadcbNe7OaoyibjqywU/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6018518518518519\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">哪个功能改了、为什么改、用户要注意什么，都对得上，我改了几句就能发。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我又让它做一份更新介绍的 PPT，准备发群里给用户看。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/zw8bZHsVSaCYuaHwgfWOosdI20e6ZIhPiaov6aK2H2B2ps3KB4YsOLqSnP7e31LD7DlTEl7kLjIIVfFTXnoSUk8jgR2VBJbusylw7O2ym2Tk/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1\" 